    {
      "id": "gap_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1716,
      "y": 558,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 158,
      "text": "Requirement: render record-level provenance in the\napproval screen — each report line shows its linked\nsubmission, card transaction, and receipt as links\nto the original records.\nAcceptance criteria:\n• 100% of report lines display all three links\n• Links open the original submission, txn, receipt\n• Approval writes the linked IDs to the audit log",
      "originalText": "Requirement: render record-level provenance in the\napproval screen — each report line shows its linked\nsubmission, card transaction, and receipt as links\nto the original records.\nAcceptance criteria:\n• 100% of report lines display all three links\n• Links open the original submission, txn, receipt\n• Approval writes the linked IDs to the audit log",
